NOTE: PYTHON MUST BE INSTALLED TO RUN predict.py AND evaluate.py

- To run the model on a specific phrase, adjust "argument" in predict.py and then run predict.py using python
- To evaluate the model on 200 random phrases from the test dataset, run evaluate.py using python
    - This will provide evaluation output in the console (e.g. model accuracy), and will create fallacy_study_dataset.csv in evaluate.py's parent folder with the evaluation results per statement.